se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a library of a small town, librarian Xiao Li is arranging various types of books. He says to reader Xiao Liu, \"There are 80 novels here, most of them are prose, some are history books, but there are almost no science fiction novels.\" Xiao Liu checks and finds that there are 20 history books.\n\n[Question]\nBefore Xiao Liu checks, how many prose does he guess?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Liu checks, he guesses there are 80 prose.\nB. Before Xiao Liu checks, he guesses there are 35 prose.\nC. Before Xiao Liu checks, he guesses there are 65 prose.\nD. Before Xiao Liu checks, he guesses there are 79 prose.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001700669157588751,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e264d6006945d2802581","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368100972,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:35:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"51369d193b304916920933c0f27b7155"}